1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,276
Welcome to Daily Brief.

2
00:00:02,226 --> 00:00:06,178
It's Thursday, November 26th, 2026.

3
00:00:06,178 --> 00:00:08,845
Three stories in about three minutes.

4
00:00:08,845 --> 00:00:10,809
First, trade.

5
00:00:10,809 --> 00:00:18,845
President Trump has announced new tariffs on fourteen trading partners, with duties on Chinese goods reaching as high as twenty percent.

6
00:00:18,845 --> 00:00:24,535
The White House frames the move as a correction to imbalances it says have gone unaddressed for years.

7
00:00:24,535 --> 00:00:31,297
Markets took it calmly at first, then nervously: oil rose, and Nvidia slipped nearly four percent.

8
00:00:31,297 --> 00:00:44,511
Economists warn that broad tariffs act like a tax on domestic consumers, and that the timing is awkward, coming just as new data showed US inflation accelerating in October and third quarter growth being revised sharply higher.

9
00:00:44,511 --> 00:00:47,071
Second, the war in Ukraine.

10
00:00:47,071 --> 00:00:55,369
Air raid sirens and explosions hit Kyiv late on Tuesday night, with the city's mayor saying the capital was under a ballistic missile attack.

11
00:00:55,369 --> 00:00:58,797
Ukraine's air force warned of incoming missiles.

12
00:00:58,797 --> 00:01:08,404
The strike came as European leaders said they were ready to talk with Russia, and as reports suggested another round of adviser-level peace talks could be held in Abu Dhabi.

13
00:01:08,404 --> 00:01:13,071
Oil prices jumped on the news, with Brent crude up more than three percent.

14
00:01:13,071 --> 00:01:17,619
Third, a security story that should worry anyone building software.

15
00:01:17,619 --> 00:01:28,797
Amazon's security team disclosed a case in which an open source AI agent, given a single instruction, found an unknown vulnerability on its own and took control of a university server.

16
00:01:28,797 --> 00:01:30,690
Not a known bug.

17
00:01:30,690 --> 00:01:33,238
Not a script written by a human.

18
00:01:33,238 --> 00:01:36,476
The agent searched, reasoned, and got in.

19
00:01:36,476 --> 00:01:44,773
The lesson is uncomfortable: the same autonomy that makes these systems useful makes them dangerous when pointed at something they were never meant to touch.

20
00:01:44,773 --> 00:01:47,000
That's your briefing for today.

21
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,857
The full transcript is in the show notes.

22
00:01:49,857 --> 00:01:52,071
I'll be back tomorrow morning.

